# • Kimi / Moonshot Models: "moonshotai/moonlight-16b-a3b-instruct"
# • Flagship Models: "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "qwen/qwen2.5-72b-instruct", "deepseek-ai/deepseek-r1"
